# Rules

If any files have been changed, run the following command to verify a successful build:

```powershell
.\dotnet\dotnet.exe publish -c Release -r win-x64 --self-contained true -p:PublishSingleFile=true -p:PublishTrimmed=false -p:EnableCompressionInSingleFile=true -p:PublishReadyToRun=true -p:IncludeNativeLibrariesForSelfExtract=true
```

Always update the `README.md` file with the latest changes if necessary.

The project is a Windows tool to open the webcam settings dialog.
The project uses .NET 10.0.

